        < x, y, m, r | [x, y] = m^2 = r^2 = 1, m^(-1)*y*m = y^(-1), m^(-1)*x*m = x*y, r^(-1)*y*r = y^(-1), r^(-1)*x*r = x^(-1), m^(-1)*r*m = r^(-1) >
      - d gives the degreebound for the Letterplace ring
