        < x, y, r, m | [x, y] = r^3 = m^2 = 1, m^(-1)*r*m = r^2, r^(-1)*x*r = x^(-1)*y, r^(-1)*y*r = x^(-1), m^(-1)*x*m = x^(-1), m^(-1)*y*m = x^(-1)*y >
      - d gives the degreebound for the Letterplace ring
"
{
